hello again fellow hunters here's a  quick guide on how to get a secret  weapon the holy moonlight sword in order  to get the holy moonlight sword you will  need to defeat Ludwig who has turned  into some type of demonic horse beast  I'll avoid spoilers on the actual fight  but once you've defeated him you'll  notice that his head still remains in  the room go ahead and listen to his  final words before he goes crazy and I  can't stop neighing uncontrollably after  talking to him go ahead and finish off  the horse head once you've done that  you'll be able to pick up the holy  moonlight sword the holy moonlight sword  seems like a pretty ordinary sword and  it's one-handed form however once  swapped a two-handed mode it glows a  nice teal color and shoots projectiles  while pressing r2 when firing off a  projectile a quick silver bullet will be  consumed you can also charge the r2 for  a stronger projectile that is sent at a  diagonal angle a non charge r2 will just  shoot straight ahead the holy moonlight  sword is a strengthened arcane based  weapon and it swings very similarly to  Ludwig's holy blade stay tuned again  spot.com for continuing coverage of  blood-borne new expansion the old  hunters  you
 

